            "body": "Could a maintainer review the fsspec cloud-JSON listing fix and approve the pending [test workflow](https://github.com/hiyouga/LlamaFactory/actions/runs/39969384686) when appropriate?\n\nThe tested head remains `7a12ce0a`. Today's cloud-JSON and converter suites pass **12 tests**, including the actual MemoryFileSystem path listing and JSON/JSONL data, with the repository's `WANDB_DISABLED=true` / `--import-mode=importlib` guidance applied.\n\nTests/CUDA/NPU/Docker runs currently report `action_required`; they have not become successful runs merely because check contexts are absent. The local checks do not cover accelerator training or Docker. The existing unrelated whole-repository Ruff W293 failure and scoped lint/build results remain explicit in the description. AI assistance was used; maintainer review is requested.\n",
